  "body": "Situated in a tranquil garden setting in the heart of the ever-popular St Heliers, this affordable, 1980s built freehold home offers a lifestyle that is hard to beat.\r\n\r\nThis home features 3 bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms, including an ensuite, an internal-access carpeted double garage with the bonus of a double carport. The living spaces flow effortlessly outdoors to a sunny and secluded fenced and gated courtyard - the perfect setting for barbeques with friends and easy family gatherings.\r\n\r\nThe location is hard to beat with St Heliers village and beachfront favourites a kilometre away and the Tamaki Link bus route just a block away.\r\n\r\nThere is a choice of excellent schools, with St Heliers School across the road, and Glendowie College, St Ignatius Catholic School and Sacred Heart College a short drive away.\r\n\r\nBuilt in the 1980's, the construction is of concrete slab foundations; the exterior cladding is timber/cedar weatherboards (lower level) and texture coated fibre cement (upper level) with aluminium joinery and decramastic tile roofing.\r\n\r\nOur owners have loved living here, but the time has come for them to downsize. Now it's your opportunity to enjoy a home that combines practical family living and a superb St Heliers location.\r\n\r\nI look forward to welcoming you at an open home or call me, Cherry Killgour on 021 780 335 to view by appointment.\r\n\r\nConjuncting agents very welcome.",
